id: ops-xhbt
title: Remove legacy absolute host paths from published git history
description: "A full-patch history scan found no credential-token or private-key patterns, but 12 patch-line matches retain an absolute home-directory prefix from old real-data test constants and PM test evidence. Current tracked files and this PR are clean. Removing published historical blobs requires a coordinated history rewrite and force-update across main, tags, open branches, npm provenance references, and every collaborator clone; it must not be improvised inside an unrelated feature PR."
