reporter: "harness:codex"
severity: medium
environment: "Public unbraind/pm-ops repository, all refs scanned with git log patch output"
repro_steps: Scan all ref patches for the absolute home-directory prefix and count 12 matching patch lines; scan current tracked files and the current patch and observe zero.
expected_result: "No public ref or reachable historical blob contains personal host paths, and all rewritten refs, signatures/provenance, release tags, PR branches, and collaborator clones are reconciled safely."
actual_result: "Credential-token patterns: 0; private-key patterns: 0; current-patch host paths: 0; historical absolute-host-path patch lines: 12."
